OpenRC
======

url    = https://github.com/OpenRC/openrc.git
tag    = 0.62.6
commit = c3689317b5b028f96c1e4912ab5281f2719665e5
date   = 2025-07-23

tools/desktop/build-openrc.sh builds this revision with
tools/desktop/patches/openrc-dragonfly.txt (DragonFly's uname, no
MNT_UNION) and stages it for installation next to rc.d; it is not used as
PID 1 or integrated with boot yet (docs/desktop-openrc.md). The pinned tag
points at a commit whose subject says version 0.62.5. Keep build output
outside the submodule; when upgrading, update the revision and checksum in
build-openrc.sh too.

License: see LICENSE and per-file notices. Complete the file-level license
and provenance review before distribution. When upgrading, review OS
support, configuration, service ordering, coexistence with rc.d and recovery,
then test the whole boot path on disposable and physical systems.
